  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** – and +\n\nGiven:\n\n110 + 728 ÷ 28 – 15 × 413 = 87\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n110 - __***728 ÷ 28***__ + 15 × 413 = 87\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n110 - 26 + ***__15 × 413__*** = 87\n\n__***110***__ - 26 ***__+ 6195__*** = 87\n\n__***6305 - 26***__ = 87\n\n6279 = 87 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 :** ÷ and –\n\nGiven: \n\n110 + 728 ÷ 28 – 15 × 413 = 87\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n110 + 728 - __***28 ÷ 15***__ × 413 = 87\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n110 + 728 – __***1.87 × 413***__ = 87\n\n__***110 + 728***__ – 770.94 = 87\n\n__***838 – 770.94***__ = 87\n\n67.60 = 87 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3: **÷ and +\n\nGiven:\n\n110 + 728 ÷ 28 – 15 × 413 = 87\n\nAfter interchange the signs;\n\n__***110 ÷ 728***__ + 28 – 15 × 413 = 87\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n0.151 + 28 – __***15 × 413***__ = 87\n\n__***0.151 + 28***__ – 6195 = 87\n\n__***28.151 – 6195***__ = 87\n\n-6166.849 = 87 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 4: **× and –\n\n**Given:**\n\n**110 + 728 ÷ 28 – 15 × 413 = 87**\n\n**After interchange the signs;**\n\n**110 + __*728 ÷ 28*__ × 15 - 413 = 87**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**110 + __*26 × 15*__ - 413 = 87**\n\n**__*110 + 390*__ - 413 = 87**\n\n**__*500 – 413*__ = 87**\n\n**87 = 87** **(LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****× and –****”.**",
